asmākaṃ sahakuṭumbānāṃ kṣemasthairyavīrya vijaya āyurārogya
aiśvaryāṇāṃ abhivṛddhyarthaṃ, samasta maṅgalāvāptyarthaṃ,
samasta duritopaśāntyarthaṃ, acañcala niṣkapaṭabhakti siddhyarthaṃ
saparivāra sāṃbaparameśvara caraṇāravindayoḥ yathāśakti
dhyānāvāhanādi ṣoḍaśopacāraiḥ śrī pañcāyatana devatānāṃ pūjanaṃ ahaṃ kariṣye ।',
       is_dynamic_sankalpam = true,
       updated_at           = now()
 where pooja_id = 'nitya_panchayatana' and step_title_en = 'Sankalpam';

